  "evidence": "TEXT_E: Pledges no rises in NI/Income Tax/VAT under strict fiscal rules; major NHS plan (extra appointments, more scanners, dentistry rescue, mental health staff, care service); 1.5m homes with restored targets, new towns, more social/affordable housing and renter protections; secure borders via a Border Security Command, clearing the asylum backlog, fast-track returns; neighbourhood policing, knife-crime plan, and action on VAWG; cost-of-living help via Warm Homes Plan and a stronger living wage; pro-growth measures (infrastructure, business rates replacement, stable corporation tax). TEXT_D: Emphasises immigration crackdown (freeze non-essential immigration, stop the boats, leave ECHR); scrapping Net Zero to cut energy bills; large tax cuts (raise thresholds, cut corporation tax); promise of zero NHS waiting lists and 40,000 more police; limited housing focus (brownfield fast-track, landlord tax changes) and dropping the Renters’ Reform Bill.",
